      "content": "but \"being quiet\" doesn't fix the hollowness. it just feels like I'm waiting for something that isn't coming back. like, if the person people actually cared about is gone, then what is the point of this body just being here? it feels like i'm just occupying space that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
